    "slug": "code-reviewer",
    "group": "services",
    "label": "Code Reviewer",
    "eyebrow": "Services",
    "title": "Code Reviewer",
    "summary": "**Code Reviewer** appears under **Services**. It is not available in this build: there is no Code Reviewer page yet, so you cannot start a run.",
    "markdown": "# Code Reviewer\n\n**Code Reviewer** appears under **Services**. It is not available in this build: there is no Code Reviewer page yet, so you cannot start a run.\n\nWhen it ships, those runs will show up in **Sessions**. Until then, use **Security Agent** for SAST/SCA findings and proposed fixes, and GitHub’s own review on pull requests from **GitHub & verify**.\n\nRelated: [Security Agent](security-agent.md) · [Sessions](../sessions.md)\n"
